  "critique": {
    "axis": "aesthetics",
    "evidence": "Strong dark forensic aesthetic, disciplined cyan/amber/red accents, and a commanding headline create a distinctive hierarchy. However, desktop composition is top-heavy with excessive dead space, while the evidence panel becomes very long and dense on tablet/mobile. Mobile typography is frequently too small, the stacked data presentation feels cramped, and the header’s clipped horizontal navigation plus missing wordmark weakens polish and orientation.",
